  "bodyHash": "1cdfdc3dd88d3ef8",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<h2><strong>Fusion</strong></h2>\n<h5>Fusion 是一个同时支持 Forge 和 Fabric 的库，为资源包和其他模组添加了额外的资源包功能，例如连接纹理（Connected Textures）和自定义实体模型！</h5>\n<h5>可以选择将模组与 Fusion 集成，以作为软依赖项。</h5>\n<h2>📖 <strong>维基</strong></h2>\n<h4><strong>面向资源包开发者：</strong><br><a href=\"https://github.com/SuperMartijn642/Fusion/wiki#for-resource-packs\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/SuperMartijn642/Fusion/wiki#for-resource-packs</a><br><strong>面向模组开发者：</strong><br><a href=\"https://github.com/SuperMartijn642/Fusion/wiki#for-resource-packs\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/SuperMartijn642/Fusion/wiki#for-mod-developers</a></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>资源包</strong></h2>\n<p>以下是适用于 Fusion 的资源包列表。</p>\n<h5>官方资源包：</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1377/882/256/256/638893928404416388.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fusion-block-transitions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion 方块过渡</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1377/890/638893930557723430.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fusion-connected-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion 连接方块</a><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1375/51/256/256/638892394958741232.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fusion-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion 连接玻璃</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1375/52/638892394985747262.webp\" alt=\"Fusion 发光矿石\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fusion-emissive-ores\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion 发光矿石</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1375/53/638892395010880381.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fusion-stacking-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion 堆叠物品</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1375/54/638892395038737978.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fusion-3d-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fusion 3D 物品</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5>第三方资源包：</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1727/284/64/64/639098995529432625_animated.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/connected-bricks-fusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">连接砖块 (Fusion)</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1727/275/64/64/639098988878948195_animated.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/connected-paths-fusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">连接路径 (Fusion)</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1727/282/64/64/639098993521023325_animated.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/connected-rocks-fusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">连接岩石 (Fusion)</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1704/271/64/64/639082583739241797.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/deep-origins-overlays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Origins 覆盖层</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1223/138/64/64/638801460024569510.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/glowing-emissive-ores-fusion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">发光矿石 - Fusion</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1163/114/64/64/638732488516403817.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mt-bgs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Midnighttigger 的优质草丛</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/910/56/64/64/638363589148143270.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mt-ct-d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Midnighttigger 的默认连接纹理</a><br></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/906/996/64/64/638357604967566677.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mt-ct-d-a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Midnighttigger 的默认连接纹理插件</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1298/7/64/64/638843737614967018.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/snow-side-texture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">雪侧纹理</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>（此列表并不完整。如果您制作了兼容 Fusion 的资源包并希望在此列出，欢迎随时在 Discord 上联系我。）</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>连接纹理</strong></h2>\n<h4>连接纹理是一种具有特殊排版的纹理，当与连接模型类型结合使用时，它们可以与其他方块无缝连接。Fusion 提供了 7 种不同的连接纹理排版，以适应各种场景。</h4>\n<h4>以下是完整排版和紧凑排版的示例：</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AoSdjrP.gif\" alt=\"带边框的木砖示例\" width=\"380\" height=\"280\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AJ9kVP5.gif\" alt=\"钢梁示例\" width=\"440\" height=\"281\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\"></strong></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>滚动纹理</strong></h2>\n<h4>滚动纹理是一种动画纹理，会在图像上进行滚动。滚动可以从纹理的任意角落开始，并流向其他任意角落，甚至包括对角线方向！<br>以下是传送带的示例：</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/CUJoRk7.png\" alt=\"滚动纹理传送带示例\" width=\"300\" height=\"230\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/uFCxMjF.gif\" alt=\"滚动纹理传送带\" width=\"400\" height=\"554\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>连续纹理</strong></h2>\n<h4>连续纹理允许创建跨越多个方块的纹理！</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1060/610/large-stone-bricks.png\" alt=\"大型石砖示例\" width=\"400\" height=\"215\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>📐 方块覆盖层</strong></h2>\n<h4>利用连接模型和连接纹理类型提供的功能，您还可以实现方块覆盖效果！</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/I6Whhhe.gif\" alt=\"沙子溢出示例\" width=\"470\" height=\"264\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1060/609/grass-overflow.png\" alt=\"草丛溢出示例\" width=\"355\" height=\"266\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>自定义实体模型</h2>\n<h4>自定义实体模型和实体模型修饰符允许资源包随机更改实体模型和纹理，或根据海拔、生物群系、维度、年龄等多种条件进行更改。</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1060/606/rooster.png\" alt=\"自定义鸡模型\" width=\"420\" height=\"272\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1060/612/snowy-cow.png\" alt=\"泰加林牛变种\" width=\"400\" height=\"273\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/gZDWWY6.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1270\" height=\"70\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>常见问题解答</h2>\n<p><strong>我可以在我的整合包中使用你的模组吗？</strong><br>是的，您被允许在整合包中使用 Fusion。<br><strong>我需要在服务器上安装 Fusion 吗？</strong><br>不需要，Fusion 仅需安装在客户端，在服务器上安装也不会产生任何作用。<br><strong>为什么 Fusion 无法与 Sodium 兼容？<br></strong>如果您使用的是 0.6 版本之前的 Sodium，则还需要安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Indium</a>。Sodium 会替换原版渲染器并使用自己的实现，这会忽略 Fabric 渲染 API。Indium 会对 Sodium 进行修补以支持 Fabric 渲染 API。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
